{"slug":"charles-barkley-violates-golden-state-warriors-fans-watch","postId":74568,"title":"Charles Barkley Violates Golden State Warriors Fans [Watch]","htmlContent":"<!-- wp:image {\"id\":515901,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/maxresdefault-2-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-515901\"/><figcaption>NBA on TNT</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On Wednesday evening, Hall of Famer Charles Barkley took his art of trash talking to the next level. When the \"Inside the NBA\" team filmed a live show in front of the Chase Center prior to Game 1 of the Western Conference Finals between the Warriors and the Mavericks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Barkley who has a history of going at with fans in the past such as the San Antonio Spurs for example, elected to pick the Dallas Mavericks to win this series. Of course the Warriors fans weren't happy to hear his selection. Warriors fans heckled the 1993 MVP, about never winning a championship in his career. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“If you don’t leave me alone, I’m going to come to your house and f—k your mama,” Barkley said</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/justasisterfro2/status/1527309033241137154?s=20u0026t=tohchcDRqjF5lHaPVnatnw\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/justasisterfro2/status/1527309033241137154?s=20&amp;t=tohchcDRqjF5lHaPVnatnw\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Other clips that were posted online feature Barkley going back and forth with the fans. “Chuck you suck” chant during the live broadcast.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“Hey, you’re right. And y’all suck too!” Barkley said.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/NBAonTNT/status/1527132676901154818?s=20u0026t=GUwcb8xhlDTdbOcMbcW1SA\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/NBAonTNT/status/1527132676901154818?s=20&amp;t=GUwcb8xhlDTdbOcMbcW1SA\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Later on during a segment that featured Warriors forward Draymond Green, <a href=\"https://twitter.com/LandonBuford/status/1527134333345185794?s=20&amp;t=LG1ZccEd56rhjdxASVUM-g\">Chuck said</a>, \"I don't dislike the area, I hate the area.\" and Green responded, \"The area hates you!\"'</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/LandonBuford/status/1527134333345185794?s=20u0026t=LG1ZccEd56rhjdxASVUM-g\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/LandonBuford/status/1527134333345185794?s=20&amp;t=LG1ZccEd56rhjdxASVUM-g\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/NBAonTNT/status/1527145369800429572?s=20u0026t=aqOJ3qwMOybcFRfES9iDiw\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/NBAonTNT/status/1527145369800429572?s=20&amp;t=aqOJ3qwMOybcFRfES9iDiw\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Golden State Warriors would go on to beat the Dallas Mavericks in game one of the Western Conference Finals 112-87. Game two is on Friday on TNT at 9 pm EST. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->","excerpt":"NBA on TNT On Wednesday evening, Hall of Famer Charles Barkley took his art of trash talking to the next level. When the \"Inside the NBA\" team filmed a live show in front of the Chase Center prior…","publishedAt":"2022-05-19T05:00:00Z","modifiedAt":"2022-05-19T05:00:00Z","author":{"slug":"tony-mcknight","displayName":"Tony McKnight"},"categories":[{"slug":"sports","name":"Sports"}],"tags":[{"slug":"byron-nelson","name":"Byron Nelson"},{"slug":"charles-barkley","name":"Charles Barkley"},{"slug":"dallas-mavericks","name":"Dallas Mavericks"},{"slug":"draymond-green","name":"Draymond Green"},{"slug":"golden-state-warriors","name":"Golden State Warriors"},{"slug":"landon-buford","name":"Landon Buford"},{"slug":"tnt","name":"TNT"}],"heroImage":{"originalUrl":"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/maxresdefault-2-1024x576.jpg"},"inlineImageUrls":["http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/maxresdefault-2-1024x576.jpg"],"readingTimeMin":1,"type":"post","link":"https://landonbuford.com/charles-barkley-violates-golden-state-warriors-fans-watch/"}